  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/02/IMG_2162.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>La cafeter&iacute;a Druida, en la calle Ausi&agrave;s March, 45 de Onda, ha acogido la noche de este viernes la obra breve La sonrisa perdida, con 2culs de Malasiento, que son Paloma Pallar&eacute;s y Esteban Pitarch, con dos finales.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeteatredruida060215/img_2150.jpg\" alt=\"img_2150\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeteatredruida060215/img_2152.jpg\" alt=\"img_2152\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeteatredruida060215/img_2153.jpg\" alt=\"img_2153\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeteatredruida060215/img_2155.jpg\" alt=\"img_2155\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeteatredruida060215/img_2156.jpg\" alt=\"img_2156\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeteatredruida060215/img_2158.jpg\" alt=\"img_2158\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeteatredruida060215/img_2160.jpg\" alt=\"img_2160\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeteatredruida060215/img_2162.jpg\" alt=\"img_2162\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeteatredruida060215/img_2164.jpg\" alt=\"img_2164\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cafeteatredruida060215/img